# Manuscript on disk

Default editor is the **plain text editor** so agents can jump to the right line (`code -g`). Do **not** open the Office / pretty markdown viewer unless Tim or the author specifically asks.

- One `#` title per chapter; scenes with `##` or `---` (or plain scene titles).  
- Names: `01-slug.md`; keep `00-table-of-contents.md` in sync.  
- No invented facts; confirm before big cuts.  
- To the author: never explain markdown syntax; if the page looks odd → short Tim note.
